<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">EZILA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Ezila</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezila</para>
  <para style="toc3">EZL</para>
  <para style="mt2">CHITABU CHA</para>
  <para style="mt1">EZILA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Ivitabu vya Ezila na cha Nehemiya chatambalisa ivyo Wayahudi wauyaga kulawa uko wasamizizagwa uko Babeli na Uwajemi. Ezila kahikiliza ivyo nawaizenge uhya Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu. Wasomi walozize wazumila kugamba Ezila nuyo awandike ichitabu cha nkongo na chakaidi cha Mihilimo iviya ichitabu cha Ezila na Nehemiya. Hegu suyo Ezila vyadahika mntu mtuhu nuyo achisanye na kuwandika ntamulizi ze ivitabu ivyo. Chitabu cha Ezila vyadahika kutende chawandikagwa mwe imihilimo ya magana mane milongo mine Kulisito henati kwelekwa. Mna izintendele izintuhu ze ichitabu chino zawandikagwa mwe chipindi chituhu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cha Ezila chalagisa ivyo Chohile amtendile seuta Koleshi ywa Uwajemi awalekeile Waizulaeli wauye kweisi yawo na kuizenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile. Uko kwendaga ni kuchintiza uwoni wa Yelemiya. Kaula Yelemiya sula 29 na 10 na 14. Kwendaga na wankondo wajezaga kuchinda kuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile hata kwendaga na chipindi indima ya Chohile naichimala, hata viyo Waizulaeli niyo wadaha kuizenga Inyumba kwa wambizi wa Chohile, iviya Ezila kawalongoza Waizulaeli kweila amasa yawo na kumhitukila Zumbe Chohile. Uko nako kwendaga na kudamanywa uhya idilagano dyawo dyo kutimila izisigilizi za Chohile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Chitabu icho chakonga kwa kutamwila ivyo seuta Koleshi awalekeile Waizulaeli wauye kwawo na kudongeleka izinkolo ivyo wawiye, sula ya nkongo na yakaidi.</para>
  <para style="io">Vikaheza chatambalisa ivyo Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yeleusalemu izengigwe, sula ya katatu na mtandatu.</para>
  <para style="io">Vikaheza ichitabu chino chatambalisa ivyo Ezila awiye Yelusalemu hamwenga na kaya za wantu watuhu sula ya mfungate na mnane.</para>
  <para style="io">Mo udumo ichitabu chatamwiloa ivyo waizulaeli wadamanye ivyo Waizulaeli wadamanye uhya lagano na Chohile sula ya chenda na yamlongo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1" />
  <para style="s">Koleshi awambiza Waizulaeli wauye kwawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1" />Mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo useuta wa Koleshi, seuta ywa Uwajemi, chani ulosi wa Zumbe Chohile alongile kujinkila muwoni Yelemiya uchinte, Zumbe Chohile niyo amtenda Koleshi, seuta ywa Uwajemi, alavye ulosi mo useuta wakwe na kuuwandika na kulonga akagamba, <verse eid="EZR 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2" />“Vino nivyo akulonga Koleshi, seuta ywa Uwajemi, Zumbe, Chohile ywa kwembingu, kaninka useuta wose we isi, naho kanilagiza nimzengele nyumba uko Yelusalemu mwe isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3" />Ivyo haluse chila mntu ywa Chohile mgati mwenyu, Zumbe Chohile atende hamwenga naye, aite Yelusalemu mweisi ya Yuda, akazenge uhya Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izilaeli, Chohile akuvikilwa uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4" />Chila asigale mjima uko ko usamizo akunga kuya, weyawe wamwambize kwa kumwinka mayuwe ya chumbu na zahabu na vintu na wanyama, hamwenga na malavyo ya mazwela kwachausa che Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="EZR 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5" />Ivyo, niyo vilongozi we izinkolo za makabila ya Yuda na Benjamini na walavyantambiko na Walawi wahalawa, na chila mntu yudya Chohile amwinkile moyo wa kwita kwizenga uhya Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, iyuko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6" />Weyawe niyo wawambiza awantu awo kwa kuwenka viya vya chumbu, zahabu na vintu vituhu na wanyama na vintu vya yombe na malavyo ye Inyumba ya Chohile.<verse eid="EZR 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7" />Seuta Koleshi niyo awavuziza iviya seuta Nebukadineza aviguhaga kulawa mwe Inyumba ya Chohile na kuvika mwe inyumba ye imilungu yakwe. <verse eid="EZR 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8" />Seuta Koleshi alagizaga iviya ivyo vigalwe ni Misiledati, mchimaila ywe hazina yakwe. Uyo kamuwaziza iviya ivyo na kumwinka Shesibaza, sekulu ywa Yuda, <verse eid="EZR 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9" />viya vilavigwe ni mabakuli ya zahabu milongo mitatu na mabakuli ya mayuwe ya chumbu elufu imwenga na visahani milongo midi na chenda, <verse eid="EZR 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10" />na wabakuli wa zahabu milongo mitatu na bakuli ndodo za mayuwe ya chumbu magana mane na mlongo na viya vituhu elufu imwenga.<verse eid="EZR 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11" />Iviya vyose vye izahabu na mayuwe ye chumbu, hamwenga ne ivintu vituhu vyendaga ni elufu shano na magana mane. Vyose ivyo Shesibaza na wantu watuhu waviguhaga na kwita navyo uko Yelusalemu mo udumo wo kwikala ko usamizo uko Babeli.<verse eid="EZR 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2" />
  <para style="s">Ludongo lwa awantu wawiye kulaila kousamizi Nehemiya 7:4-73</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1" />Wano nawo awantu we isi ya Izulaeli walaile kousamizo wadya Nebukadineze seuta ywa Babeli awegalaga watahwa Babeli saviya wafungwa, niyo wauya mwe isi ya Yelusalemu na mwe isi ya Yuda, chila mntu auyaga ko mzi wakwe. <verse eid="EZR 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2" />Ivilongozi wawo wendaga ni Zelubabeli na Yeshua na Nehemiya na Selaya na Leelaya na Modekai na Bilishani na Misipali na Bigwai na Lehumu na Baana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 2:2">Zino ni zinkolo za awantu wa Izilaeli wawiye kulawa kousamizo, <verse eid="EZR 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3" />wolukolo lwa Paloshi ni, elufu mbili gana dimwenga na milongo mfungate na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4" />Wantu wo lukolo lwa Shefatiya ni, magana matatu milongo mfungate na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Ala ni, magana mfungate na milongo mfungate na washano, <verse eid="EZR 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Pahashi Mmoabu kugamba welekwa wa Yeshua na Yoabu ni elufu mbili na magana mnane na mlongo umwenga na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7" />wolukolo lwa Elamu ni elufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mishano na wane, <verse eid="EZR 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Zatu ni, magana chenda na milongo mine na washano, <verse eid="EZR 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Zakai ni, magana mfungate na milongo mtandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Bani ni magana mtandatu na milongo mine na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Bebai ni magana mtandatu milongo midi na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Azigadi ni, elufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo midi na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Adonikamu ni magana mtandatu na milongo mtandatu na mtandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Bigwai ni elufu mbili na milongo mishano na mtandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Adini ni magana mane na milongo mishano na wane, <verse eid="EZR 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Ateli kugamba Hezekiya ni milongo chenda na mnane, <verse eid="EZR 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Besai ni magana matatu na milongi midi na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Yola ni wantu gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Hashumu ni wantu magana maidi na milongo midi na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20" />wantu wo lukolo lwa Gibali ni milongo chenda na washano. <verse eid="EZR 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21" />Awantu womzi wa Betelehemu ni gana dimwenga na milongo midi na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22" />wantu womzi wa Netofa ni milongo mishano na mtandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23" />wantu womzi wa Anatoli ni gana dimwenga na milongo midi na mnane, <verse eid="EZR 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24" />wantu womzi wa Azimaveti ni milongo mine na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25" />wantu womzi wa Kiliati Yealimu, na Kefila na Beeloti ni magana mfungate na milongo mine na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26" />wantu womzi wa Lama na Geba ni magana mtandatu na milongo midi na yumwenga, <verse eid="EZR 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27" />wantu womzi wa Mikimashi ni gana dimwenga na milongo midi na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28" />wantu we imizi ya Beteli na Ai ni magana maidi na milongo midi na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29" />wantu womzi wa Nebo ni, milongo mishano na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30" />wantu wawiye kulawa kousamizo womzi wa Magibishi ni gana dimwenga na milongo mishano na mtandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31" />wantu wo mzi wa Elamu wa kaidi ni, elufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mishano na wane, <verse eid="EZR 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32" />wantu womzi wa Halimu ni, magana matatu na milongo midi, <verse eid="EZR 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33" />wantu womzi wa Lodi na Hadidi na Ono ni magana mfungate na milongo midi na washano, <verse eid="EZR 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34" />wantu womzi wa Yeliko ni magana matatu na milongo mine na washano, <verse eid="EZR 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35" />wantu womzi wa Senaa ni elufu ntatu na magana mtandatu na milongo mitatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36" />Wano ni wantu wa nkolo za Walavyantambiko wawiye kulawa kousamizo, walavyantambiko wo ulukolo lwa Yedaya, wendaga welekwa wa Yeshua wantu magana chenda na milongo mfungate na watatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37" />walavyantambiko wolukolo lwa Imeli ni, elufu imwenga na milongo mishano na waidi, <verse eid="EZR 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38" />walavyantambiko wolukolo lwa Pashuli ni, elufu imwenga na magana maidi na milongo mine na mfungate, <verse eid="EZR 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39" />walavyantambiko wolukolo lwa Halimu ni elufu imwenga na mlongo umwenga na mfungate. <verse eid="EZR 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40" />Luno ni ludongo lwa Walawi, welekwa wa Yeshua na Kadimieli, welekwe ni Hodaviya wawiye kulawa kousamizo ni wantu milongo mfungate na wane. <verse eid="EZR 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41" />Wachemi walaile ko usamizo uko Babeli welekwa wa Asafu ni gana dimwenga na milongo midi na mnane. <verse eid="EZR 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42" />Wachimaila wo mwingilo we Inyumba ya Chohile welekwa wa Shalumu na Ateli na Talimoni na Akubu na Hatita na Shobai, wendaga ni, gana dimwenga milongo mitatu na chenda. <verse eid="EZR 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43" />Zino ni nkolo za wandima we Inyumba ya Chohile wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa wendaga ni welekwa kulawa kolukolo lwa Siha na Hasufa na Tabaoti, <verse eid="EZR 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44" />kulawa molukolo lwa Kelosi na Siaha na Padoni, <verse eid="EZR 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45" />kulawa ulukolo lwa Lebana na Hagaba na Akubu, <verse eid="EZR 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Hagabu na Shamlai na Hanani, <verse eid="EZR 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Gideli na Gahali na Leaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Lezini na Nekoda na Gazamu, <verse eid="EZR 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Uza na Paseya na Besai, <verse eid="EZR 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Asina na Meunimu na Nefusimu, <verse eid="EZR 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Bakibuki na Hakufa na Halihuli, <verse eid="EZR 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Basilusi na Mehida na Halisha, <verse eid="EZR 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Balikosi na Sisela na Tema, <verse eid="EZR 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54" />kulawa kolukolo lwa Nesiya na Hatifa. <verse eid="EZR 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55" />Nkolo za welekwa wa wandima wa Sulemani wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizagwa, zendaga ni ulukolo lwa Sotai na Hasofeleti na Peluda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56" />lukolo lwa Yaala na Dalikoni na Gideli, <verse eid="EZR 2:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57" />lukolo lwa Shefatiya na Hatili na Pokeleti Hezabaimu na Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58" />Wandima wose we Inyumba ya Chohile na welekwa wa awandima wa Sulemani wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa wendaga ni, magana matatu na milongo chenda na waidi.<verse eid="EZR 2:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59" />Iviya awantu we imizi ikutimila, wauyaga ni womzi wa Teli Mela wa Teli Halisha wa Kelubu wa Adani na wa Imeli, mna hawabunkulwe kugamba wendaga welekwa wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="EZR 2:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60" />Awo wendaga wo lukolo lwa Delaya na Tobiya na Nekoda, wendaga wantu magana mtandatu na milongo mishano na waidi.<verse eid="EZR 2:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61" />Awantu wezinkolo zikutimila za walavyantambiko iviya wauyaga kulawa ko usamizo, ulukolo lwa Hobaiya na Hakosi na ulukolo lwa Balizilai. Uyo Balizilai endaga asolaga mndele ywa Balizilai ywa Gileadi, umntu uyo naye niyo etangwa Balizilai. <verse eid="EZR 2:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62" />Awo walondaga amazina yawo mwo ludongo lwe izinkolo zawo mo lukumbusa lwawo, mna hawawoneke. Ivyo niyo walemezwa kutenda walavyantambiko kwaviya wadunduga kulagisa wowo wazumilika kumvikila Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 2:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63" />Sekulu awagamba hawakungigwa kudya kande iyo ilavigwe kwa Chohile vyaungwa atendeke aho mlavyantambiko akudaha kuza kwa Chohile kwa sila ya Ulimu na Sumimu. <verse eid="EZR 2:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64" />Awantu wose wauyaga kulawa uko wasamizizwaga wendaga ni, elufu milongo mine na midi na magana matatu na milongo mtandatu, <verse eid="EZR 2:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65" />ukaleka awo, kwendaga na wandima wagosi na wavyele elufu mfungate na magana matatu na milongo mitatu na mfungate, naho kwendaga na wachemi wagosi na wavyele, wose wendaga magana maidi. <verse eid="EZR 2:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66" />Wendaga na falasi magana mfungate na milongo mitatu na mtandatu na mpundafalasi magana maidi na milongo mine na shano, <verse eid="EZR 2:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67" />na ngamiya magana mane na milongo mitatu na shano, na mpunda elufu mtandatu na magana mfungate na milongo midi.<verse eid="EZR 2:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68" />Awantu awo walawaga uko wasamizizagwa, weze wabule kwe Inyumba ya Chohile uko komzi wa Yelusalemu, ivilongozi wamwenga we izinkolo izo niyo walavya malavyo ya kweungila chani kwambiza uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu hadya yendaga. <verse eid="EZR 2:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69" />Walavyaga chila mntu viya adahile kwa chausa che indima ino. Amalavyo yose yendaga chilo magana mashano ya zahabu na chilo elufu mbili na magana mnane ya mayuwe ya chumbu na suche gana dimwenga kwa chausa cha walavyantambiko.<verse eid="EZR 2:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70" />Ivyo, walavyantambiko, Walawi na wamwenga wa awantu watuhu wakongaga kwikala mo mzi wa Yelusalemu na mwe zikaya zakwe. Wachemi na wamizi we Inyumba ya Chohile na wandima we Inyumba ya Chohile niyo wakonga kwikala mwe imizi yawo. Waizilaeli wose wekalaga mwe imizi yawo.<verse eid="EZR 2:70" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuzengwa uhya Imazabahu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1" />Wize ubule mwezi wa mfungate, na wantu wa Izilaeli wakatenda wekala mwe mizi yawo, wantu wose wechisanya hamwenga mo mzi wa Yelusalemu, <verse eid="EZR 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2" />Yeshua, mwana ywa Yosadaki, hamwenga na walavyantambiko weyawe na Zelubabeli mwana ywa Shealitieli, hamwenga no lukolo lwakwe, niyo wazenga uhya imazabahu ya Chohile ywa Izilaeli, chani wadahe kumlaviza malavyo ya kutikimya saviya viwandikwe mwe isigilizi ya Musa, mntu ywa Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3" />Waizengaga imazabahu iyo hantu ahadya yendaga aho kale, kwa viya nawaka wogoha awantu wadya wendile wakekala mwe isi iyo. Wakaheza watenda wakamlaviza Zumbe malavyo ya kutikimya mlanga mwakwe chila zuwa no mtondo na chisingi. <verse eid="EZR 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4" />Waitenda ingasu ya makumbi saviya viwandikwe mwe isigilizi, chila zuwa nawakalavya malavyo ya kutikimya yaungigwe kwa chausa cha zuwa idyo. <verse eid="EZR 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5" />Naho nawakalavya malavyo ya mazwela hamwenga ne izo chila zuwa yadya nayakatikimya vijima na malavyo yendaga yakalavigwa chipindi cha zuwa dya ngasu ya mwezi mhya na mwe mazuwa makulu matuhu yose yalagizwe ni Zumbe. Naho, nawakalavya ntambiko zose zilavigwe kwa kunga kwawo. <verse eid="EZR 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6" />Hatahegu msingi we nyumba ya Chohile nendile haunati kuzengwa, wantu na wakonga kulavya malavyo ya kutikimya kwa Zumbe Chohile kukongela zuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa mfungate.<verse eid="EZR 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukonga kuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7" />Wantu walavya hela za kuwaliha wata kusongola mayuwe na wazesi na wasongola mbawo, iviya nawakalavya nkande, na vintu vya kunywegwa na mavuta ya mizaituni, chani vigalwe mwe mizi ya Tilo na Sidoni vileke wenkigwe miti ya mielezi kulaila Lebanoni. Miti iyo yegalagwa kwa sila ya bahali kubula Yopa. Ayo yose yadamanyika kwa wambizi wa seuta Koleshi wa Pelisia. <verse eid="EZR 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8" />Ivyo, wantu wakongaga ndima mo mwezi wa kaidi wo mwaka wa kaidi weze wabule kweinyumba ya Chohile mo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Zelubabeli mwana ywa Shealitieli na Yeshua mwana ywa Yosadaki na walukolo wawo watuhu na walavyantambiko na Walawi na wantu watuhu wose wawiye Yelusalemu kulawa uko wasamizizagwa, welungaga nawo mwe ndima iyo. Walawi wose wendaga na mihilimo milongo midi hegu kujinka, wasagulagwa chani wachimaile ndima yo kuzenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9" />Yeshua na wana wakwe na walukolo wakwe, hamwenga na Kadimieli na wana wakwe, wo lukolo lwa Yuda wehangaga kuchimaila uzesi we nyumba ya Chohile. Wambizagwa ni welekwa wa Henadadi na walukolo weyawe Walawi.<verse eid="EZR 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10" />Wazesi eze wakonge kuzenga umsingi we Inyumba ya Chohile, walavyantambiko wakatenda wavika izi suche zawo zo ulavyantambiko, niyo wachimala hantu hawo na magunda mwe mikono. Walawi nawo wo lukolo lwa Asafu awo wachemi niyo wachimala na vilangu vyawo, ivyo, wamtunya Zumbe Chohile kutimilana na malagizo ya seuta Daudi wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="EZR 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11" />Niyo wachema wakaisana, wakamtunya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 3:11">“Kwaviya ni ywedi, uwedi wakwe kwa Izilaeli wekala kalenakale.” Wantu wose niyo wenuila amaizwi yawo kwa nguvu zawo zose, wakamtogola Zumbe kwa kukonga kuzengwa umsingi we Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12" />Walavyantambiko walozize na Walawi na vilongozi wa nkolo wendile wadalahala na wadya waionaga inyumba ya nkongo, niyo waila kwa izwi kulu weze waone umsingi we Inyumba ya Chohile impya wazengwa, hatahegu wantu watuhu walozize wenulaga maizwi kwa chinyemi. <verse eid="EZR 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13" />Wantu wadunduga kuwazagula maizwi ya chinyemi hegu ya ndilo kwaviya yendaga yaloza na kwivika hale vitendese.<verse eid="EZR 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4" />
  <para style="s">Uzesi uhya Inyumba ya Chohile wahigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1" />Vikaheza wankondo wa Yuda na Benjamini weze weve kugamba wantu wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa niyo wazenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile, Chohile ywa Waizulaeli, <verse eid="EZR 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2" />wambasa Zelubabeli na vilongozi we izinkolo na kumgamba, “Chehange mo uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile. Suwe chose chavikila Chohile ywenyu, nendile chikamlaviza malavyo kukongela chikale mwa Esali hadoni, seuta ywa Ashulu, achiletile hano.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3" />Mna Zelubabeli na Yeshua na vilongozi watuhu wezinkolo za Izilaeli niyo wawagamba, “Suwe hachikunga wambizi wowose kulawa kwenyu chani chizenge Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu. Suwe wenye nachimzengele Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izilaeli, saviya seuta Koleshi ywa Uwajemi achilagize.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4" />Ivyo, awantu wendile wakekala ahantu aho niyo wakonga kuwatenda wafe chevu na kuwatisa Wayahudi chani wasekujendeleza kuzenga saviya wekambile. <verse eid="EZR 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5" />Naho wawafumbasa amasekulu wo ulongozi wa Ashulu wawahige Wayahudi. Wajendeleza kudamanya ivyo mwe ichipindi chose cho ulongozi wa Koleshi, kubula ichipindi cho useuta wa Dalio.<verse eid="EZR 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzesi uhya wa Yelusalemu wahigwa vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6" />Aho nkongo mo ulongozi wa seuta Ahasuwelo, wankondo wa awantu wendile wakekala uko Yuda na Yelusalemu wawandikaga ulahi mwa awo na kumwigaila seuta Ahasuwelo.<verse eid="EZR 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7" />Naho mwe ichipindi cho ulongozi wa Alitashasita, seuta ywa Uwajemi na Bishilamu na Misiiledati na Tabeeli na wambuya zawo, wamwandikilaga seuta Alitashasita baluwa, Baluwa iyo yawandikagwa kwa mawandiko ya Chialamu na kutapitwa mo kusomwa.<verse eid="EZR 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8" />Naho sekulu Lehumu na Shimishai na mkulu wo mkowa, wamwandikilaga Alitashasita baluwa kuwalanga wantu wa Yelusalemu ikugamba, <verse eid="EZR 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9" />Baluwa ino yalawa kwa usekulu wa Lehumu na Shimishai mta kuwandika wo mkowa hamwenga na wetu, na wakantila na masekulu wose wadya umo mwe nkongo walawaga Eleki na Babiloni na Susa mwe isi ya Elamu, <verse eid="EZR 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10" />hamwenga na awantu wa si ntuhu idya Asuli banipali, mntu mkulu na mta nguvu awasamizaga na kuwaika mo mzi wa Samaliya na hantu hatuhu mo mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Eufulati.<verse eid="EZR 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11" />Ibaluwa yenye yendaga savino, “Kwa seuta Alitashasita, suwe wandima wako mo mkowa wo uswelo wa zuwa wa Eufulati, chakwigaila ndamsa.” <verse eid="EZR 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12" />“Chaunga weye seuta umanye, kugamba Wayahudi wezile kulawa ntendele ntuhu yo useuta wako waita Yelusalemu naho wauzenga uhya umzi ukwikalwa ni wantu wavu na wabanasi. Wabindiliza kuzenga iviwambaza vyakwe na kudamanya imisingi. <verse eid="EZR 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13" />Ivyo, chaunga umanye, weye seuta, kugamba mzi uno una zengwa uhya ne viwambaza vyakwe vina heza, hawalavye kodi, hegu maliho, naho ihazina yako naihunguke. <verse eid="EZR 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14" />Haluse, kwaviya suwe chakwetegeleza weye hachikunga kuwona ukabelwa, nivyo vikuleka chiwona ni vyedi chikugambile, <verse eid="EZR 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15" />chani udamanye uzuza mwe ichitabu cha wababa zako. Umo nowone kugamba kukongela nkongo, umzi uno wendaga na wata kuhituka na wata kuwatumbwadisa maseuta na masekulu we mikowa, na kugamba kukongela nkongo awantu wakwe na ni wankumbizi vitendese, nivyo vilekile umzi uwo ukabalangwa. <verse eid="EZR 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16" />Ivyo, seuta chakugambila kugamba umzi uwo unazengwa uhya, ne viwambaza vyakwe vinaheza kuzengwa, hodahe kuulongoza umkowa we intendele ya uswelo wa zuwa wo mto wa Eufulati.”<verse eid="EZR 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17" />Vikaheza seuta niyo awahitula, “Kwa Lehumu sekulu mta kuwandika na kwa Shishai mkulu wo mkowa, hamwenga na awetu wose wakwikala Samaliya na hantu hatuhu mo mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Eufulati.” <verse eid="EZR 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18" />“Ibaluwa mnigaile itapitwa na kusomwa kulongozi kwangu. <verse eid="EZR 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19" />Silavya lagizo udamanywe uzuza na ibunkulwa kugamba nichindedi kugamba kukongela nkongo umzi uno wa Yelusalemu wendile ukawahiga maseuta na kugamba awantu wakwe watenda wata kuhitukila na wankumbizi wakulu. <verse eid="EZR 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20" />Maseuta wata nguvu woulongozaga umzi uwo hamwenga no mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Eufulati wakatoza kodi na maliho mo useuta. <verse eid="EZR 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21" />Ivyo, lavyani lagizo awantu awo waleke kuzenga uhya umzi uwo kubula aho nanilavize malagizo matuhu. <verse eid="EZR 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22" />Naho, sinyisani mse kukawa kudamanya ivyo, nnase kubanikilwa.”<verse eid="EZR 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23" />Ahadya weze wasomelwe ibaluwa ino kulawa kwa Alitashasita na Lehumu, sekulu Shimishai na weyawe niyo wasunguza kwita Yelusalemu na kuwatintisa kwa nguvu Wayahudi waleke kuzenga umzi.<verse eid="EZR 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile wakonga vituhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24" />Indima yo uzesi uhya we Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu yachimalaga na kwikala ivyo kubula umhilimo wa kaidi wo useuta wa Dalio ywa Pelisiya.<verse eid="EZR 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1" />Mwe ichipindi icho, waoni waidi, Hagai na Zekaliya, mwana ywa Ido wawalavizaga uwoni Wayahudi wendile wakekala Yuda na Yelusalemu, mwa zina dya Chohile ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2" />Zelubabeli, mwana ywa Shealitieli na Yeshuwa mwana ywa Yosadaki, weze weve ulosi uwo niyo wakonga vituhu kuizenga Inyumba ya Chohile mo mzi wa Yelusalemu, wakambizwa ni wawoni wa Chohile.<verse eid="EZR 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3" />Chipindi icho, Tatenai endaga sekulu ywa mkoa wa uswelo wa zuwa wo mto wa Eufulati na Shetahali bozenai na weyawe waitaga Yelusalemu na kuuza, “Ni yuhi awalagizeni kuizenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile kubula kuibindiliza?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4" />Iviya niyo wauza, amazina ya wadya wakuzenga Inyumba ya Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5" />Mna Chohile nendile akawadima ivilongozi wa Wayahudi, ivyo amasekulu awo hawawalemeze kubula aho wamwandikilaga baluwa seuta Dalio na kumanya chiya akulonga. <verse eid="EZR 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6" />Ivyo, Tatenai, sekulu ywo mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Eufulati na Shetahali bozenai na weyawe, niyo wamwandikila baluwa seuta Dalio. <verse eid="EZR 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7" />Ibaluwa iyo igamba vino, “Kwa seuta Dalio, chakungila utondowazi.” <verse eid="EZR 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8" />“Weye seuta chaunga umanye kugamba chita ko mkowa wa Yuda uko ili Inyumba ya Chohile Mkulu. Inyumba ino yazengwa uhya kwa mayuwe makulu ne viwambaza vyakwe vikwa migamba. Indima iyo yadamanywa kwa untanda mkulu naho yajendeleza vitana vitendese.” <verse eid="EZR 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9" />“Chiwauza ivilongozi awo wachigambile ni yuhi awalagize wazenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile kubula kuikomeleza. <verse eid="EZR 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10" />Iviya chiwauza amazina yawo chani chikugambile weye seuta wadya wakulongoza indima iyo.” <verse eid="EZR 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11" />“Wantu awo wachihitula vino, ‘Suwe chiwandima wa Chohile ywa kwe mbingu ne isi, chaizenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile idya yazengagwa na kuheza aho nkongo ni seuta yumwenga mkulu ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EZR 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12" />Mna kwaviya mababa zetu weze wamwihize Chohile ywa kwe mbingu, uyo niyo awaleka wahudwe ni seuta Nebukadineza ywa Babuloni, mntu ywa Kalidayo, abalange inyumba ino ya Chohile na kuwegala wantu kousamizo uko Babuloni aibalange Inyumba ya Chohile ino na kuwegala awantu kudya wasamizizagwa uko Babuloni. <verse eid="EZR 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13" />Mna mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo ulongozi wakwe seuta Koleshi ywa Babuloni alavyaga lagizo Inyumba ya Chohile ino izengwe uhya. <verse eid="EZR 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14" />Uyo kavivuza iviya vye zahabu na mayuwe ya chumbu viya seuta Nebukadineza aviguhaga kulawa mwe Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu na kuvika mwe inyumba ye milungu yakwe uko Babeli. Iviya Koleshi avyusaga mwe Inyumba ya Chohile kudya Babuloni. Kamwinka mntu akwitangwa Sheshabaza yudya amsagulaga atende sekulu ywa Yuda. <verse eid="EZR 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15" />Seuta kamgamba aguhe iviya ivyo avivuze mwe Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu, na kuizenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile hantu yendaga aho nkongo. <verse eid="EZR 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16" />Ivyo Sheshabaza ezaga na kwika umsingi we Inyumba ya Chohile mo mzi wa Yelusalemu, na kukongela ichipindi icho uzesi naukajendeleza kubula haluse, mna hainati kubindilikila.’” <verse eid="EZR 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17" />“Haluse, uneva vyakuwagila weye seuta, lagiza kudamanywe uzuza mwa mazuwa ya jinkile yo seuta mo mzi wa Babeli saviya seuta Koleshi hegu chindedi kalavyaga lagizo Inyumba ya Chohile izengwe uhya komzi wa Yelusalemu. Vikaheza, chigambile viya ukuwona.”<verse eid="EZR 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6" />
  <para style="s">Malagizo ya seuta Dalio yabunkulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1" />Ivyo Seuta Dalio alavyaga lagizo wantu wadamanye uzuza mwe lukumbusa zikigwe mwe vyumba vyo kwikiya vintu uko Babeli mo lukumbusa we chiseuta. <verse eid="EZR 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2" />Mna ichitabu chibwilwa ko mzi wa Ekibatana mo mkowa wa Media, chendaga na malagizo sayano, <verse eid="EZR 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3" />“Mo mhilimo wa nkongo wo useuta wakwe, seuta Koleshi alagizaga Inyumba ya Chohile izengwe uhya mo mzi wa Yelusalemu, na itende hantu hakulaviza ntambiko na malavyo ya kutikimya. Ichimo chakwe na chitende mita milongo midi na mfungate na wangalamu wakwe mita milongo midi na mfungate. <verse eid="EZR 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4" />Iviwambaza vyakwe navizengwe kwa nchanjale umwenga wa mgamba mlanga mwa chila nchanjale ntatu itende ya mayuwe makulu. Amaliho yose yalihwe kulawa mwe ihazina ya seuta. <verse eid="EZR 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5" />Naho, iviya vyose vye zahabu na mayuwe ye chumbu viya seuta Nebukadineza egale Babeli mwe inyumba ya Mnungu ywakwe vivuzwe kwe Inyumba ya Chohile uko Yelusalemu na kwikwa chila chimwenga ahantu hakwe mwe Inyumba ya Chohile.”<verse eid="EZR 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dalio alagiza indima ijendeleze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6" />Vikaheza Dalio niyo egala ulosi sauno, “Kwa Tatenai, sekulu ywa mkoa wa uswelo wa zuwa wa Eufulati na Shetahali bozenai na masekulu weyawo ko mkowa.” “Walekeni ikalani hale nawo, <verse eid="EZR 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7" />naho lekani indima yo uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile ujendeleze. Mlekeni sekulu ywa Yuda ne vilongozi wa Wayahudi waizenge Inyumba ya Chohile hantu hakwe. <verse eid="EZR 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8" />Naho, nalagiza kugamba nyuwe namuwambize mwe indima iyo. Maliho yawo yose hehena kukawa kulawa kwe hazina ya seuta ikulawa mwe ikodi ikuchisanywa ko mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wo umto wa Eufulati, chani uzesi unase kuchimala. <verse eid="EZR 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9" />Chila zuwa msekuleka kuwenka walavyantambiko wa Yelusalemu chila chintu nawaunge, vikatenda ni wajeku hegu ndolome hegu wana ngoto kwa malavyo ya kutikimya kwa Chohile ywa kwembingu, hegu ngano na munyu na divai hegu mavuta ya mizaituni. <verse eid="EZR 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10" />Vino vyose vidamanywe chani wadahe kumlaviza Chohile ywa kwembingu malavyo yakumuwagila naho wanilombezeze ujimbiko miye seuta na wanangu. <verse eid="EZR 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11" />Naho nalagiza kugamba mntu yoyose yudya hanazumile idilagizo dino, msomo ung'olwe kulawa mwe inyumba yakwe naho usongolwe na kutumbulwa na uwo umsomo. Naho inyumba yakwe itendwe zalazala. <verse eid="EZR 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12" />Elo Chohile ausagulaga umzi wa Yelusalemu kutenda hantu hakwe ha kumvikila na amgwise seuta hegu si yoyose nahige idilagizo dino hegu kunga kuibalanga Inyumba ya Chohile iyuko komzi wa Yelusalemu. Miye Dalio silavya idilagizo dino, vyaungwa ditimilwe.”<verse eid="EZR 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyumba yatedwa ya Zumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13" />Vikaheza, Tatenai, sekulu ywa mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wo mto wa Eufulati na Shetahali bozenai na masekulu weyawe, wahikiliza kujesa idilagizo dya seuta Dalio. <verse eid="EZR 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14" />Ivilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wajendeleza vyedi vitendese ne indima yo uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile, wakajelwa moyo ni muwoni Hagai na Zekaliya, mwana ywa Ido. Wabindiliza uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile saviya walagizwe ni Chohile ywa Izilaeli saviya walagizwe ni seuta Koleshi na seuta Dalio na seuta Alitashasita wa Pelisiya. <verse eid="EZR 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15" />Uzesi we Inyumba ya Chohile ubindilikila mwe idizuwa dya katatu dyo mwezi ukwitangwa Adali, mo mhilimo wa mtandatu wo useuta wa seuta Dalio. <verse eid="EZR 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16" />Vikaheza, awantu wa Izilaeli na walavyantambiko na Walawi na awantu watuhu wadya wauyaga kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa waikaga Inyumba iyo kulongozi kwa Chohile kwa mbwedo utendese. <verse eid="EZR 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17" />Mwe ichipidi cho kwisenta Inyumba ya Chohile, walavyaga majeku gana dimwenga, na ndolome magana maidi na wana ngoto magana mane ya malavyo, na mavulata mlongo umwenga na mbili kwa chausa cha lavyo dya kusa masa na mbuzi imwenga kwa chila kabila dya Izilaeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18" />Seivyo, kwa chausa cha indima ya Chohile mwe Yelusalemu, wawaikaga walavyantambiko mwe mabunga yawo ya Walawi kwa luzo lwawo kutimilana na malagizo yawandikwe mwe ichitabu cha Musa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasu ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19" />Mwe idizuwa dya mlongo na nne dyo mwezi wa nkongo, wantu wendile wauya kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa wadamanyaga ngasu ya Pasaka. <verse eid="EZR 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20" />Walavyantambiko na Walawi wetenda wazumilike kwa Chohile, wose wendaga wakuka vitendese. Walawi wachinjaga mwana ngoto ywa Pasaka kwachausa cha wantu wose wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa, walukolo wawo walavyantambiko na kwachausa cha wowo wenye. <verse eid="EZR 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21" />Elo, Waizulaeli wadyaga umwana ngoto ywe Pasaka wendaga ni wadya wose wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa hamwenga na awantu watuhu wesentile ne izintendwa zihiye za awantu we izisi ntuhu vileke wamvikile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EZR 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22" />Kwa chipindi cha mazuwa mfungate awantu wavinaga kwa mbwedo idizuwa kulu dye mikate heijeligwe hamila, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile awenkaga mbwedo na kumwinka seuta ywa Ashulu moyo wa ungi kwawo, niyo awambiza mwe indima yo usezi we Inyumba ya Chohile, ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="EZR 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7" />
  <para style="s">Ezila abula Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1" />Vikaheza, mwe chipindi cho useuta wa Alitashasita ywa Uwajemi, hendaga na mntu yumwenga endile aketangwa Ezila. Ezila endaga mwana ywa Selaya, mwana ywa Azaliya, mwana ywa Hilikiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2" />Hilikiya endaga mwana ywa Shalumu, Shalumu mwe mazuwa ya mwana ywa Sadoki, Sadoki endaga mwana ywa Ahitubu, <verse eid="EZR 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3" />mwana ywa Amaliya, mwana ywa Azaliya, mwana ywa Melayoti, <verse eid="EZR 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4" />mwana ywa Zelahiya, mwana Uzi, Uzi endaga mwana ywa Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5" />Buki endaga mwana ywa Abishuya, Abishuya endaga mwana ywa Finehasi, mwana ywa Eleazala, mwana ywa Aloni, mlavyandambiko mkulu.<verse eid="EZR 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6" />Ezila akulawaga Babuloni, uyo endaga muwandika mta umanyi ulozize mwe isigilizi idya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, amwinkaga Musa. Na kwa wambizi wa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywakwe, seuta amwinkaga Ezila chila chintu aungile. <verse eid="EZR 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7" />Mo mhilimo wa mfungate wo usekulu wa seuta Alitashasita, Ezila akongaga ntambo kulawa Babuloni kwita Yelusalemu. Wamwenga mwa awantu wa Izulaeli, walavyantambiko na Walawi na wachemi na wamila nyivi na wandima we Inyumba ya Chohile waitaga hamwenga na uyo. <verse eid="EZR 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8" />Wabulaga komzi wa Yelusalemu mwe idizuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa shano mo mhilimo wa mfungate wo useuta wa Alitashasita. <verse eid="EZR 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9" />Zumbe Chohile aitendaga intambo iyo itende yedi vitendese waikongaga zuwa dya nkongo dyo mwezi wa nkongo. <verse eid="EZR 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10" />Ezila endaga elavyaga umoyo wose kuhina sigilizi ya Zumbe, kuidamanya na kuwahinya wantu wa Izilaeli malagizo na sigilizi zakwe.<verse eid="EZR 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluwa ya seuta Alitashasita kwa Ezila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11" />Ibaaluwa iyo ya seuta Alitashasita amwigaile Ezila, mlavyantambiko na mta kuwandika na mhinya mta umanyi wa sigilizi na malagizo ya Zumbe Chohile awenkaga awantu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="EZR 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12" />“Kulawa kwa Alitashasita, seuta mkulu ywa maseuta, kwa Ezila, mlavyantambiko naho mntu mta umanyi wa kuhinya sigilizi za Chohile ywa kweimbingu ndamsa.” <verse eid="EZR 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13" />“Nalagiza kugamba kujinkila mo usekulu wangu wantu wose wa Izilaeli, walavyantambiko na Mlawi kugamba akunga kuya Yelusalemu kwa kunga wenye, adaha kwita hamwenga na weye. <verse eid="EZR 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14" />Miye, hamwenga nawalangilizi wangu mfungate, chakusigila ukadamanye uzuza uko Yuda na Yelusalemu ukakaule hegu isigilizi ya Chohile ywako idya akwinkile uneva yatimilwa viya vikuwagila. <verse eid="EZR 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15" />Guha mayuwe ya chumbu na zahabu, idya miye na awambizi wangu chimlaviza Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli kwa kweungila wenye, yudya Inyumba yakwe iyuko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16" />Uguhe mayuwe ya chumbu ne izahabu yose nochisanye mo mkowa wose wa Babeli, hamwenga na malavyo ya kweungila walavize awantu wa Izulaeli na walavyantambiko wawo kwachausa che Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile ywawo iyuko Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="EZR 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17" />“Jeseza vihande ivyo vye chumbu kwa untanda vitendese kwa kugula majeku na ndolome na wana ngoto hamwenga na malavyo ya uhule na divai na kuvilavya mlanga mwe mazabahu mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywenyu, iyuko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18" />Amayuwe ye ichumbu ne izahabu naisigale wadaha uzijeseze hamwenga na awantu weyawo saivyo namunge, kutimilana na viya vikumuwagila Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19" />Ne iviya winkigwe kwa chausa cho kuvikila mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywako nomlavize Chohile uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20" />Chintu chochose nounge kwachausa che Inyumba ya Chohile ywako, wadaha uchipate kulawa mwe ihazina ya seuta.” <verse eid="EZR 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21" />“Miye, seuta Alitashasita, nalavya lagizo kwa wose wakudima ihazina mo mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wo mto Eufulati kugamba, sunguzani mwinkeni chila chintu Ezila naunge, mlavyantambiko, na mhinya sigilizi ya Chohile ywa kwembingu, <verse eid="EZR 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22" />Hata hegu ni mayuwe ya chumbu yasekujinka chilo elufu ntatu na magana mane na ngano chilo elufu mlongo umwenga na lita elufu mbili za divai na lita elufu mbili za mavuta ya mizaituni na munyu chilo zozose naunge. <verse eid="EZR 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23" />Chila chintu alagize Chohile ywa kwembingu, kwa chausa che Inyumba yakwe, naho mjese kwa ukanuni anasekuwihiwa useuta wangu hegu wanangu. <verse eid="EZR 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24" />Iviya chawagambilani hamkungwa mkachisanya kodi kwa walavyantambiko, na Walawi na wachemi na wachimaila umwingilo na wandima watuhu we Inyumba ino ya Chohile.” <verse eid="EZR 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25" />“Weye Ezila, kwa kujeseza ubala akwinkile Chohile ywako, wike wakanti na walamuzi na wawalongoze wekazi wose wo mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wo mto Eufulati kudya wakwikala kutimilana ne isigilizi ya Chohile ywako. Mhinye yudya heimanyize isigilizi iyo. <verse eid="EZR 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26" />Na mntu yoyose hekwiva isigilizi ya Chohile ywako, na sigilizi ya seuta, asunguze kukantilwa hegu kukomwa hegu kusamizwa hegu kuhokwa ugoli wakwe hegu kujelwa mwe chifungo.”<verse eid="EZR 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezila amtogola Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27" />Ezila niyo agamba, “Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wababa zetu, uyo amwinkile moyo seuta mkulu wa kuitunya Inyumba ya Chohile iyuko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28" />Kwa wedi wakwe Chohile, sinkwa wambizi wa seuta na masekulu wakwe wata udahi mnkulu. Senka moyo kwaviya Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu, nendile ehamwenga na miye, niyo nawachisanya ivilongozi wa Izilaeli chani wauye hamwenga na miye.”<verse eid="EZR 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wawiye kulawa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1" />Luno nulo uludongo lwe vilongozi we izinkolo za awantu wawiye hamwenga na miye Ezila kulawa Babeli uko wasamizizagwa, mwe ichipindi cho usekulu wa seuta Alitashasita. <verse eid="EZR 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2" />Welekwa wa Finehasi chilongozi endaga Gelishoni ulukolo lwa Itamali chilongozi endaga Danieli, kulawa ulukolo lwa Daudi chilongozi endaga Hatushi, <verse eid="EZR 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3" />walaile kwa awelekwa wa Shekaniya no ulukolo lwa Paloshi chilongozi endaga Zekaliya hamwenga na wagosi gana dimwenga na milongo mishano wo lukolo lwakwe, wawandikwe hamwenga naye. <verse eid="EZR 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Pahati mntu ywa Moabu chilongozi ywawo endaga Eliehoenai, mwana ywa Zelahiya hamwenga na wagosi magana maidi. <verse eid="EZR 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Zatu chilongozi endaga ni Shekaniya mwana ywa Yahazieli auyaga hamwenga na wagosi magana matatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Adini chilongozi ywawo endaga Ebedi mwana ywa Yonasani auyaga hamwenga na wagosi milongo mishano. <verse eid="EZR 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Elamu chilongozi ywawo endaga Yesaya mwana ywa Ataliya auyaga hamwenga na wagosi milongo mfungate. <verse eid="EZR 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8" />Walaile ko lukolo lwa Shefatiya chilongozi endaga Zebadia mwana ywa Mikaeli auyaga hamwenga na wagosi milongo mnane. <verse eid="EZR 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9" />Walaile ko lukolo lwa Yoabu chilongozi endaga Obadiya mwana ywa Yehiele auyaga hamwenga na wagosi magana maidi na mlongo mnane. <verse eid="EZR 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10" />Walaile ko lukolo lwa Bani chilongozi endaga Shelomiti mwana ywa Yosifiya auyaga hamwenga na wagosi gana dimwenga na milongo mtandatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11" />Walaile ko lukolo lwa Bebai chilongozi endaga Zekaliya mwana ywa Bebai auyaga hamwenga na wagosi milongo midi na mnane. <verse eid="EZR 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Azigadi chilongozi endaga Yohanani mwana Hakatini auyaga hamwenga na wagosi gana dimwenga na mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="EZR 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Adonikamu vilongozi wendaga Elifeleti na Yeueli na Shemaya wawiye hamwenga na wagosi milongo mtandatu, wano wauyaga nyumani. <verse eid="EZR 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14" />Walaile ko ulukolo lwa Bigwai vilongozi wendaga Utai na Zakuli wawiye hamwenga na wagosi milongo mfungate.<verse eid="EZR 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezila alonda Walawi kwachausa che Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15" />Siwachisanya hamwenga mnkanda mo mto ukuhinga komzi wa Ahava, na kwika lago kwa mazuwa matatu. Niyo nawakaula awantu wose na walavyantambiko mna siwone Walawi mgati mwawo. <verse eid="EZR 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16" />Niyo nasigila vilongozi chenda weze, Eliezeli na Alieli na Shemaya na Elinatani na Yalibu na Elinatani na Natani na Zekaliya na Meshulamu hamwenga na wahinya waidi, Yoyalibu na Elinatani. <verse eid="EZR 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17" />Siwasigila kwa Ido chilongozi ywa wantu wa Kasifia, simlombeza uyo hamwenga na weyewe wasankane mwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18" />Kwa ungi wakwe Chohile, kachigaila Shelebiya mntu mta ubala Mlawi wo lukolo lwa Mahili, hamwenga na wanawe na walukolo wakwe mlongo umwenga na mnane. <verse eid="EZR 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19" />Iviya kachigaila Hashabiya na Yeshaya, wose wo lukolo lwa Melali, hamwenga na walukolo wawo milongo midi. <verse eid="EZR 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20" />Ukaleka awo, kwendaga na wasankana we Inyumba ya Chohile magana maidi na milongo midi, awo wababa zawo wendaga wasagulagwa ni seuta Daudi na masekulu wakwe wawambize Walawi. Amazina yawo yawandikagwa.<verse eid="EZR 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezila alongoza awantu wafunge na kulombeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21" />Vikaheza, nalavyaga malagizo kugamba wantu wose chibule haguhi no mto wa Ahava chani chifunge na kunyanyahala kulongozi kwa Chohile ywetu chimlombeze achidime na kuchilongoza mwe intambo yetu hamwenga na wanetu. <verse eid="EZR 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22" />Nanisoni kumlombeza seuta bunga dya wagomba nkondo na wakwela falasi wachidime na wankondo wetu mwe isila kwaviya nasimgambila kale kugamba Chohile awajimbika wadya wose wakumlonda, mna awehiwa na kuwakantila wadya wose wakumleka. <verse eid="EZR 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23" />Ivyo chifunga na kumlombeza Chohile ywetu kwa chausa cha ayo, uyo niyo achihitula.<verse eid="EZR 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malavyo kwachausa che Inyumba ya Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24" />Vikaheza, mgati mwe ivilongozi wa awalavyantambiko nasagulaga mlongo na waidi, Shelebiya na Hashabiya hamwenga na weyawe mlongo umwenga. <verse eid="EZR 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25" />Wano nawahimilaga kwa chihimo, mayuwe ya chumbu na zahabu na viya vyose vyalavyagwa ni seuta na walangilizi wakwe na masekulu wakwe hamwenga na awantu wa Izulaeli kwachausa cha malavyo ye Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu. <verse eid="EZR 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26" />Vino nivyo ivintu nawahimilaga, mayuwe ya chumbu chilo elufu milongo midi na mbili, viya vidamanywe kwa mayuwe ya chumbu chilo milongo mfungate, zahabu chilo elufu ntatu na magana mane, <verse eid="EZR 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27" />mabakuli milongo midi ya zahabu uzami wakwe chilo mnane, viya vidi vya shaba yedi ikung'ala, vina yombe saviya ya zahabu.<verse eid="EZR 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28" />Vikaheza niyo nawagamba, “Nyuwe mwi wantu wa Zumbe Chohile. Seivyo iviya navyo ni vya Chohile, chumbu na zahabu ni malavyo ya kweungila nyuwe wenye kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wababa zenyu. <verse eid="EZR 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29" />Hampu vidimeni na kuvitundulia kwa untanda ivintu ivyo, kubula aho na mvihime kulongozi kwa walavyantambiko wakulu, na Walawi na wakulu we vilongozi we izinkolo za Izulaeli, uko Yelusalemu, mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30" />Elo walavyantambiko na Walawi wahokela ichumbu ne izahabu ne viya, chani wavigale Yelusalemu kwe Inyumba ya Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="EZR 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntambo ya kuya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31" />Mwe idizuwa dya mlongo na mbili dyo mwezi wa nkongo, chatambaga kulawa komto wa Ahava, nakwita Yelusalemu, Chohile ywetu achamizaga na kuchidima mwa wankondo wetu na wadya wakwebunga wantu mwe sila. <verse eid="EZR 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32" />Eze chibule Yelusalemu, niyo chahumula kwa mazuwa matatu. <verse eid="EZR 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33" />Mwe idizuwa dya kane, niyo chaita mwe Inyumba ya Chohile, Chohile ywetu chahimaga ichumbu ne izahabu ne iviya, chikaheza niyo chamwinka mlavyantambiko Melemoti mwana ywa Uliya. Melemoti endaga hamwenga na Eleazali mwana ywa Finehasi, na Walawi waidi, Yozabadi mwana ywa Yeshua na Noadiya mwana ywa Binui. <verse eid="EZR 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34" />Chila chintu chawazagwa na kuhimwa na uzami wa chila chintu wawandikagwa.<verse eid="EZR 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35" />Vikaheza, wadya wose wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa wamlavizaga Chohile ywa Izulaeli malavyo yawo ya kutikimya, njeku mlongo umwenga na mbili kwachausa cha Waizuaeli wose, na ndolome milongo chenda na mtandatu na wana ngoto milongo mfungate na mfungate iviya walavyaga mbuzi mlongo umwenga na mbili saviya lavyo dya kusa masa. Awanyama wose awo walavyagwa watende lavyo dya kutikimya kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="EZR 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36" />Seivyo wawenkaga amasekulu wa seuta na maseuta wo mkowa wa uswelo wa zuwa wo mto Eufulati ivyo wasigilagwa ni seuta, niyo walavya wamb izi kwa wantu na kwachausa che Inyumba ya Chohile.<verse eid="EZR 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli wasola wavyele sawo Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1" />Vize viheze ivyo, niyo ivilongozi wanibasa na kunigamba, “Wantu wa Izulaeli na walavyantambiko na Walawi, hawesentile na awekazi we isi wadya wakudamanya yakwihiza, Waamoli na Wamoabu na Wamisili na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Wapelezi na Wayebusi na Waamoni. <verse eid="EZR 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2" />Wayahudi wakusola wavyele wachijeni iviya kuwaloza wabwanga wawo wajeni. Ivyo, wantu wasagulwe ni Chohile wahangana na wantu wa si ntuhu, ivyodu masekulu na wakulu nawo wankongo kudamanya ayo yakwihiza. <verse eid="EZR 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3" />Eze nive izimbuli izo, niyo natatula izi suche zangu ne inkazu yangu, niyo nang'ola izi fili zangu ne zindevu zangu kwa chinyulu chitendese na kwikala hasi kwa nkama. <verse eid="EZR 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4" />Niyo awantu wose wengilwe ni nkama kwachausa che izimbuli alongile Chohile ywa Izlaeli mwa masa ya wadya wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa wakonga kwechisanya haguhi na miye, nami niyo natenda na nkama kubula nechisingi, chipindi cho kulavya ntambiko.<verse eid="EZR 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5" />Chisingi mwe ichipindi cho kulavya ntambiko, niyo nenuka hadya ahantu nekale kwa chinyulu kuno izisuche zangu ne inkazu yangu zitatuke, niyo nafikamadi na kumchulusiza imikono yangu Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywangu.” <verse eid="EZR 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6" />Hagamba, “Hoi Chohile ywangu, nawona soni nkulu kwinula umtwi wangu kulongozi kwako. Masa yetu yalozesa kujinka imitwi yetu, heye, mlema wetu ubula kwembingu. <verse eid="EZR 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7" />Kukongela amazuwa ya wababa zetu, suwe awantu wako chibalangisa. Na kwachausa cha amasa yetu, suwe na maseuta wetu na walavyantambiko wetu, chihudwa ni maseuta we zisi zechijeni naho nachikomwa, nachitahigwa na kuhokwa ugoli wetu. Kubula vino dyelo, chijelwa soni vitendese. <verse eid="EZR 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8" />Mna haluse weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, kwa chipindi chijihi kuchilagisa izimbazi zako na kuwadahiza awamwenga wetu kusumka kulawa kousamizo na kwikala kwa utondowazi ahantu hano hakukile. Ukaleka utumwa kuchinka mbwedo na wikazi mhya. <verse eid="EZR 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9" />Hata hegu nendile chiwatumwa huchilekile chikale mo utumwa. Kuwatenda maseuta wa Uwajemi watende wedi kwetu na kuchilekeila chikale kwa utondowazi na kuizenga uhya Inyumba ya Chohile yako yendile ibogozoke, hano Yuda na Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="EZR 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10" />“Mna haluse, Hoi Chohile ywetu, chigeze yeze yajinke ayo yose? Hachitimile imiko yako, <verse eid="EZR 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11" />uchinkile kwa sila ya wandima wako wawoni. Wachigambaga si mkwita kwikala na kutenda yenyu ibalangwa ni wihi wa wantu wakwila umo walaile mwesi zesimile, kwawihi kwa kudamanya mbuli zikwihiza chila hantu. <verse eid="EZR 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12" />Elo, msekuwaloza awantu awo wachiche wenyu, hegu kuwalekeila wabwanga wenyu kusola wachiche wawo, naho msekutumbwazika mo utondowazi hegu ukuchumilwa kwawo, chani nyuwe wenye mtende na nguvu, naho mbwede yedi ye isi iyo nakuwalekela wana wenyu saviya ulisi wa kalenakale. <verse eid="EZR 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13" />Ukaleka ayo yose yachigwele kwachausa cha amsa yetu, yalozize, chivimanya kugamba inkanto uchinkile, we Chohile ywetu ni ndodo ukaliganya no uwihi wetu, na kuwaleka watuhu watende no ujima. <verse eid="EZR 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14" />Kwambwani chisekutimila sigilizi zako vituhu kwa kuwaleka wana wetu wa chilume na wachiche wetu wasolane na awantu wano wakudamanya wihi uno? Nawihiwe nakuchikoma asekusigala hata mntu yumwenga nahone. <verse eid="EZR 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15" />Elo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, weye wadamanya vichumile mna kuchileka chisigaile savino chili vino dyelo. Cheila amasa yetu kulongozi kwako, chikamanya kugamba hahana mta wedi yoyose akwiza kulongozi kwako kwachausa cha amasa yano.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10" />
  <para style="s">Kusolana na wantu sawo Wayahudi kwalemezwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1" />Umo Ezila endile akalombeza na kweila kuno akaila na kwedula hasi chifudifudi kulongozi kwe Inyumba ya Chohile, bunga kulu dya awantu wa Izulaeli, wagosi na wavyele na wana, wechisanyaga hajihi nauyo wakaila kwa chinyulu chitendese. <verse eid="EZR 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2" />Elo, Shekaniya, mwana ywa Yehieli, wo lukolo lwa Elamu, niyo amgamba Ezila, “Chiswesa ukanuni kwa Chohile kwa kusola wavyele wajeni we isi ino, mna ukaleka ivyo kuchei na msuhi mwa awantu wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3" />Haluse nachidamanyeni lagano na Chohile ywetu chilekane na awavyele wano hamwenga na awana wawo, kwa kutimilana na ulangilizi wako na wawadya awatuhu wakwiva imiko ya Chohile. Yose yadamanywe kwa kutimila isigilizi. <verse eid="EZR 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4" />Inuka, ijese imbuli ino weidaha suwe nachelunge na weye, kwenke moyo udamanye ivyo.” <verse eid="EZR 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5" />Ivyo Ezila niyo akonga kuwatenda walavyantambiko ne ivilongozi na Walawi na Waizulaeli watuhu wose welise kugamba na wadamanye saviya vilongigwe ni Shekaniya, nawo niyo wazumila. <verse eid="EZR 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6" />Vikaheza Ezila niyo ahalawa kulongozi kwe Inyumba ya Chohile, nakwita kwa Yehohanani mwana ywa Eliyashibu. Ezila niyo ekala uko chilo chijima hadile hegu kunywa mazi, kwe chinyulu endilie ananacho kwaviya wa wantu walaile kudya wasamizizagwa nawaswesa ukanuni. <verse eid="EZR 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7" />Lugong'ondo lwigalwa chila hantu mwe isi yose ya Yuda na komzi wa Yelusalemu kugamba wantu wose walaile Babeli wechisanye uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="EZR 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8" />Kuligana na malagizo yalavigwe ni vilongozi, uneva mntu yoyose ana dunduga kubula mwe chipindi cha mazuwa matatu, ivintu vyakwe vyose navitahigwe naho uyo naalemezwe kwelunga na awantu wawiye kulawa kudya wasamizizagwa. <verse eid="EZR 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9" />Mwa amazuwa ayo amatatu, zuwa dya mlongo dya mwezi wa chenda, wantu wose wekalaga mwe isi ya Yuda na Benjamini wabulaga Yelusalemu na kwechisanya mo lwazo lwe Inyumba ya Chohile. Nawakazingiza kwachausa che imbuli wetangilwe na kwachausa che ifula nkulu naikanya vitendese. <verse eid="EZR 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10" />Mlavyantambiko Ezila niyo achimala na kulonga nawo. Akagamba, “Hamwiwakanuni kwaviya msola wavyele wajeni, ivyo mwiyongezeza mlema mwe Izulaeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11" />Haluse, kweileni amasa yenyu kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa wababa zenyu, na kudamanya yadya yakumuwagila. Kwenegeni na wekazi we si ino na kuwaleka wakazi zenyu awajeni.” <verse eid="EZR 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12" />Awatu wose niyo wahitula kwa hamwenga kwa izwi, “Chiva, nachidamanye saivyo ukulonga.” <verse eid="EZR 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13" />Mna niyo wajendeleza kulonga wakagamba, “Awantu walozesa, naho ifula yanyelesa. Hachi kudaha kujendeleza kuchimala hano holwazo savino. Ino siyo mbuli ikudaha kudamanywa mwe zuwa dimwenga hegu maidi, kwaviya wantu walozize mwetu wadamanye amasa yano. <verse eid="EZR 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14" />Naviwagila amasekulu wetu wasigaile komzi wa Yelusalemu wasankanile imbuli ino ha awantu wose. Vikaheza chila mntu mta mvyele mjeni eze mwe chipindi chikigwe hamwenga na ivilongozi na wakanta wo mzi wakwe. Ivyo nivyo navinaleke amaya yatendese ya Chohile nayauswe mwe imbuli ino.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15" />Hahana mntu ahigile imbuli iyo ukaleka Yonasani mwana ywa Asaheli na Yazeya mwana ywa Tikwa, niyo walungwa mkono ni Meshulamu na Shabetai ywe idikabila dya Walawi. <verse eid="EZR 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16" />Awantu wose walaile kudya wasamizizagwa niyo wazumila imbuli iyo, ivyo Ezila mlavyantambiko awasagulaga wagosi mgati mwe ivilongozi wezinkolo zesimile na kudongelesa amazina yawo. Umo mwe idizuwa dya nkongo dya mwezi wa mlongo, wantu awo niyo wakonga indima yawo yo uzuza we imbuli iyo, <verse eid="EZR 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17" />na miezi mitatu itimile wabindaga uzuza wawo mwa awagosi wose wendaga wasoile wavyele wajeni.<verse eid="EZR 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagosi wata wavyele sawo Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18" />Luno nulo uludongo lwa awagosi wendile wasoile wavyele sawo Wayahudi, Walavyantambiko kuligana ne izinkolo zawo, ulukolo lwa Yeshua, mwana ywa Yehosadaki na walukolo wakwe, ni Maaseya na Eliezeli na Yalibu na Gedaliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19" />Awo walaganaga kuwasa awavyele wawo, ivyo chila yumwenga niyo alavya ndolome itende lavyo dya mlema wawo. <verse eid="EZR 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20" />Ulukolo lwa Imeli, ni Hanani na Zebadiya. <verse eid="EZR 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21" />Ulukolo lwa Halimu, ni Maaseya na Eliya na Shemaya na Yehieli na Uziya. <verse eid="EZR 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22" />Ulukolo lwa Pashuli, ni Eliehoenai na Maaseya na Ishimaeli na Nasanieli na Yozabadi na Elasa. <verse eid="EZR 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23" />Walawi wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Yozabadi na Shimei na Kelaya endaga ana zina tuhu aketangwa Kelita, na Petahiya na Yuda na Eliezeli. <verse eid="EZR 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24" />Mgati mwa wachemi wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni ni Eliyashibu. Na mgati mwa awamizi we Inyumba ya Chohile, ni Shalumu na Telemu na Uli. <verse eid="EZR 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25" />Na wantu watuhu wasoile wavyele sawo Wayahudi wo lukolo lwa Paloshi, ni Lamiya na Iziya na Malikiya na Miyamini na Eliazali na Malikiya na Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26" />Ulukolo lwa Elamu wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni ni Mataniya na Zekaliya na Yehieli na Abudi na Yelemoti na Eliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27" />Ulukolo lwa Zatu wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Eliehoenai na Eliashibu na Mataniya na Yelemoti na Zabadi na Aziza. <verse eid="EZR 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28" />Ulukolo lwa Bebayi wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Yehohanani na Hananiya na Zabayi na Atilayi. <verse eid="EZR 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29" />Ulukolo lwa Bani wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni ni Meshulamu na Maluki na Adaya na Yashubu na Sheali na Yelemoti. <verse eid="EZR 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30" />Ulukolo lwa Pahashi Mmoabu wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Adina na Kelali na Benaya na Maaseya na Mataniya na Besaleli na Binui na Manase. <verse eid="EZR 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31" />Ulukolo lwa Halimu wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Eliezeli na Ishiya na Malikiya na Shemaya na Shimeoni, <verse eid="EZR 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32" />na Benjamini na Maluki na Shemaliya. <verse eid="EZR 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33" />Ulukolo lwa Hashumu wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Matenayi na Matata na Zabadi na Elifeleti na Yelemayi na Manase na shimeyi. <verse eid="EZR 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34" />Ulukolo lwa Bani wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni ni Maadayi na Amlamu na Ueli, <verse eid="EZR 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35" />na Benaya na Bedeya na Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36" />na Waniya na Melemoti na Eliashibu, <verse eid="EZR 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37" />na Mataniya na Matenayi na Yaasu. <verse eid="EZR 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38" />Ulukolo lwa Binui, ni Shimeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39" />na Shelemiya na Nasani na Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40" />na Makinadebayi na Shashayi na Shalayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41" />na Azaleli na Shelemiya na Shemaliya, <verse eid="EZR 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42" />na Shalumu na Amaliya na Yosefu. <verse eid="EZR 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43" />Ulukolo lwa Nebo wasolaga wavyele wa chijeni, ni Yeieli na Matitiya na Zabadi na Zebina na Yadayi na Yoeli na Benaya. <verse eid="EZR 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44" />Awagosi wano wose wasolaga wavyele wajeni. Ivyo niyo wawaleka awavyele awo wahalawe hamwenga na awana wawo.<verse eid="EZR 10:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10" />
</usx>